      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2025-june/q3",
      "question": "<p><em>[In this question, <span data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\mathbf j\"></span> are horizontal unit vectors due east and due north respectively.]</em></p><p>A particle <span data-math=\"P\"></span> of mass <span data-math=\"0.5\\,\\mathrm{kg}\"></span> moves with constant acceleration <span data-math=\"(2\\mathbf i-2.4\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span> on a smooth horizontal plane under the action of a constant horizontal force <span data-math=\"\\mathbf F\\,\\mathrm N\"></span>.</p><p>(a) Find <span data-math=\"\\mathbf F\"></span> in terms of <span data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\mathbf j\"></span>. <strong>(1)</strong></p><p>At time <span data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, <span data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving with velocity <span data-math=\"(-7\\mathbf i+7.8\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span></p><p>(b) Find the velocity of <span data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span data-math=\"t=2\"></span> seconds. <strong>(2)</strong></p><p>(c) Find the direction of motion of <span data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span data-math=\"t=2\"></span> seconds, giving your answer as a bearing in degrees. <strong>(3)</strong></p><p>At time <span data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, <span data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the point <span data-math=\"O\"></span>.</p><p>At time <span data-math=\"t=5\"></span> seconds, <span data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the point <span data-math=\"A\"></span>.</p><p>(d) Find <span data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{OA}\"></span> in terms of <span data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\mathbf j\"></span>. <strong>(2)</strong></p>",
