      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2025-june/q4",
      "question": "<p><em>[In this question, position vectors are given relative to a fixed origin <span data-math=\"O\"></span>.]</em></p><p>At time <span data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span data-math=\"t&gt;0\"></span>, the position vector of a particle <span data-math=\"P\"></span> is <span data-math=\"\\mathbf r\"></span> metres where</p><p><span data-math=\"\\mathbf r=4t^{3/2}\\mathbf i-t^2\\mathbf j\"></span></p><p>(a) Find the position vector of <span data-math=\"P\"></span> at <span data-math=\"t=4\"></span> <strong>(1)</strong></p><p>(b) Find the exact distance of <span data-math=\"P\"></span> from <span data-math=\"O\"></span> at <span data-math=\"t=4\"></span> <strong>(2)</strong></p><p>(c) Find an expression for the velocity of <span data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span data-math=\"t&gt;0\"></span>, giving your answer in terms of <span data-math=\"t\"></span>, <span data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\mathbf j\"></span> <strong>(2)</strong></p><p>At <span data-math=\"t=T\"></span>, the acceleration of <span data-math=\"P\"></span> is in a direction that is perpendicular to the line with equation <span data-math=\"y=\\frac13 x\"></span></p><p>(d) Find the value of <span data-math=\"T\"></span>. <strong>(4)</strong></p>",
